<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>{{bundle.title}}</title>
  <style>
    :root { --brand: {{brand.accentColor}}; --on-brand: {{brand.onAccentColor}}; --ink: #121414; --paper: #f6f2e9; --muted: #6f716d; }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
    body { margin: 0; color: var(--ink); background: #fff; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; print-color-adjust: exact; -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; }
    .page { width: 210mm; height: 297mm; padding: 19mm 18mm 17mm; position: relative; overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always; background: #fff; }
    .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
    .folio { position: absolute; left: 18mm; right: 18mm; bottom: 10mm; padding-top: 4mm; border-top: .25mm solid #ddd7cc; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; color: #aaa69f; font-size: 8pt; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .folio b { color: var(--brand); }
    .cover { color: #f7f3ea; background: #101212; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; }
    .cover::after { content: ''; position: absolute; width: 150mm; height: 150mm; right: -70mm; top: 30mm; border: .3mm solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 35%, transparent); border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 0 0 25mm color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 4%, transparent), 0 0 0 50mm color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 2%, transparent); }
    .cover > * { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
    .logo { font-size: 9pt; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .13em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .cover-copy { max-width: 155mm; }
    .kicker, .eyebrow { color: var(--brand); font-size: 8pt; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .15em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    h1 { margin: 7mm 0 6mm; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 37pt; line-height: 1.08; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
    .cover .subtitle { max-width: 125mm; color: #aaa9a3; font-size: 13pt; line-height: 1.6; }
    .cover-meta { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: end; padding-top: 7mm; border-top: .25mm solid #343737; color: #797c79; font-size: 8pt; line-height: 1.6; }
    .intro { background: var(--paper); display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 52mm; gap: 16mm; }
    .intro h2, .contents h2, .content h2, .checklist h2 { margin: 5mm 0 8mm; font: 400 27pt/1.15 Georgia, serif; letter-spacing: -.025em; }
    .intro p, .content p { color: #4d504d; font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 1.75; }
    .intro-aside { border-left: .7mm solid var(--brand); padding-left: 7mm; }
    .intro-aside span { display: block; margin-bottom: 3mm; color: #8f8e88; font-size: 7.5pt; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .12em; }
    .intro-aside strong { font: 400 16pt/1.35 Georgia, serif; }
    .contents { background: #fff; }
    .contents-list { list-style: none; margin: 17mm 0 0; padding: 0; border-top: .25mm solid #ddd7cc; }
    .contents-list li { padding: 5mm 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 11mm 1fr auto; gap: 5mm; border-bottom: .25mm solid #ddd7cc; align-items: baseline; }
    .contents-list span:first-child { color: var(--brand); font: 400 11pt Georgia, serif; }
    .contents-list b { font-size: 10pt; }
    .contents-list small { color: #99958d; font-size: 8pt; }
    .content { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    .section-number { color: #ddd8ce; font: 700 50pt/1 var(--font, Arial); margin-bottom: 9mm; }
    .body-copy { columns: 2; column-gap: 12mm; column-rule: .25mm solid #ece8df; }
    .body-copy p { margin: 0 0 5mm; break-inside: avoid; }
    blockquote { margin: auto 0 13mm; padding: 7mm 0 0 8mm; border-left: .8mm solid var(--brand); font: italic 17pt/1.45 Georgia, serif; }
    blockquote small { display: block; margin-top: 3mm; color: #99958d; font: 7.5pt Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .checklist { background: #101212; color: #f7f3ea; }
    .checklist h2 { max-width: 145mm; font-size: 31pt; }
    .checks { margin-top: 16mm; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0 12mm; }
    .check { padding: 7mm 0; border-top: .25mm solid #353838; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 10mm 1fr; gap: 4mm; color: #b9bab6; font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 1.55; }
    .check b { width: 7mm; height: 7mm; border: .5mm solid var(--brand); color: var(--brand); display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 7pt; }
    .cta { background: var(--brand); color: var(--on-brand); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; }
    .cta .eyebrow { color: var(--on-brand); opacity: .7; }
    .cta h2 { max-width: 150mm; margin: 7mm 0; font: 400 34pt/1.1 Georgia, serif; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
    .cta p { max-width: 125mm; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--on-brand); opacity: .82; }
    .cta-button { margin-top: 10mm; align-self: flex-start; padding: 5mm 8mm; background: var(--on-brand); color: var(--brand); font-size: 9pt; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <section class="page cover">
    <div class="logo">{{project.intake.companyName}}</div>
    <div class="cover-copy">
      <div class="kicker">A practical field guide</div>
      <h1>{{bundle.title}}</h1>
      <div class="subtitle">{{bundle.subtitle}}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="cover-meta"><span>Developed from original expert source material</span><span>Prepared by Afterword</span></div>
  </section>
  <section class="page intro">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">Executive summary</div>
      <h2>{{bundle.campaignAngle}}</h2>
      <p>{{bundle.executiveSummary}}</p>
    </div>
    <aside class="intro-aside"><span>Built for</span><strong>{{project.intake.audience}}</strong></aside>
    <div class="folio"><span>{{project.intake.companyName}}</span><b>02</b></div>
  </section>
  <section class="page contents">
    <div class="eyebrow">Inside this guide</div>
    <h2>A practical route through the central argument.</h2>
    <ol class="contents-list">{{#each bundle.sections}}<li><span>{{number}}</span><b>{{title}}</b><small>{{#if sourceTimestamp}}{{sourceTimestamp}}{{else}}Source checked{{/if}}</small></li>{{/each}}</ol>
    <div class="folio"><span>{{project.intake.companyName}}</span><b>03</b></div>
  </section>
  {{#each bundle.sections}}
  <section class="page content">
    <div class="section-number">{{number}}</div>
    <div class="eyebrow">{{eyebrow}}</div>
    <h2>{{title}}</h2>
    <div class="body-copy">{{#each body}}<p>{{this}}</p>{{/each}}</div>
    {{#if pullQuote}}<blockquote>“{{pullQuote}}”{{#if sourceTimestamp}}<small>Source reference {{sourceTimestamp}}</small>{{/if}}</blockquote>{{/if}}
    <div class="folio"><span>{{../project.intake.companyName}}</span><b>{{folio}}</b></div>
  </section>
  {{/each}}
  <section class="page checklist">
    <div class="eyebrow">Implementation checklist</div>
    <h2>Turn the central idea into a decision your team can use.</h2>
    <div class="checks">{{#each bundle.actionChecklist}}<div class="check"><b>✓</b><span>{{this}}</span></div>{{/each}}</div>
    <div class="folio"><span>{{project.intake.companyName}}</span><b>Action</b></div>
  </section>
  <section class="page cta">
    <div class="eyebrow">A practical next step</div>
    <h2>{{project.intake.callToAction}}</h2>
    <p>Continue the conversation with {{project.intake.companyName}} and turn the ideas in this guide into a plan for your situation.</p>
    <div class="cta-button">{{project.intake.website}}</div>
  </section>
</body>
</html>
